# Personal trading data — never commit your journal.
# Your trades live in browser storage, and the optional disk-sync folder
# (trades_data/) wherever you pointed it — usually ~/Documents. These
# entries guard against accidentally copying those files into this repo
# and pushing them to GitHub.
trades_data/
trades.json
capital.json
rules.txt
trading-journal.csv
trading-journal.json